{
  "description": "approve: the document can go ahead (bot); the overall comment is empty, section comments are allowed. request_changes: revise it first; needs a non-blank overall comment or at least one section comment. done / skipped: the person did it or skipped it (actor user). acknowledged: info only (actor none), with an optional note.",
